3. Inventory View Abstraction

Create a single view used by:

UI

Camunda rule engine

allocation validation


CLO_LOAN_INVENTORY_VIEW

Example:

CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW CLO_LOAN_INVENTORY_VIEW AS
SELECT *
FROM LOAN_INVENTORY_DAILY;

When freeze happens:

CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW CLO_LOAN_INVENTORY_VIEW AS
SELECT *
FROM LOAN_INVENTORY_MONTHLY
WHERE SNAPSHOT_DATE =
(
SELECT FREEZE_STATIC_UPDATE_DATE
FROM CLO_REPLENISHMENT_CYCLE
WHERE CYCLE_STATUS != 'CLOSED'
);

Now:

UI
Camunda rules
Allocation queries

all use the same view.

No code changes.


