Step 4 — CLO Service

CLO service:

UPSERT CLO_HEDGE

Example SQL:

MERGE INTO CLO_HEDGE t
USING (SELECT :hedge_id hedge_id FROM dual) s
ON (t.hedge_id=s.hedge_id)
WHEN MATCHED THEN
UPDATE SET
reqd_hedge_amt=:amount
WHEN NOT MATCHED THEN
INSERT
(
hedge_id,
loan_id,
req_type,
reqd_hedge_amt,
created_cycle_id
)
VALUES
(
:hedge_id,
:loan_id,
:req_type,
:amount,
:cycle_id
);


